SUMMARY: Killer B Cinema Presents: Golden Bat!
DESCRIPTION:Join us on May 1st for Golden Bat! The world’s first superher
 o! You heard that right!\n\n\nAdvanced tickets are $5 or $8 at the door (
 Space is limited\, and tickets sell out fast)!\n\n\nTicket link: www.even
 tbrite.ca/e/killer-b-cinema-presents-golden-bat-tickets-1986713916806?aff
 =oddtdtcreator https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/killer-b-cinema-presents-golde
 n-bat-tickets-1986713916806?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\n\nDoors open at 7:30 pm\
 , and the movie begins at 8:00.\n\n\n*NO outside food or drinks\; please 
 buy food and drinks from the venue.\n\n\n*All films have closed captionin
 g.\n\n\nMovie info:\n\nGolden Bat is a Japanese superhero created by Suzu
 ki Ichiro and Takeo Nagamatsu in the autumn of 1930\, who originally debu
 ted in a kamishibai (paper theater). Some consider Ōgon Bat to be the wor
 ld's first superhero and a precursor to later superhero characters such a
 s the Japanese kamishibai character Prince of Gamma (debut in the early 1
 930s) and the American comic book characters Superman (debut in 1938) and
  Batman (debut in 1939).\n\n\nWhen the Earth is threatened by an evil ali
 en\, a group of UN scientists travels to the lost city of Atlantis\, wher
 e they unearth a superhuman mummy named The Golden Bat who is prophesied 
 to help the humans survive this terrible attack. {Wikipedia}\n\n\nInfo ab
 out See-Scape:\n\nOur movies will be shown on the second floor! There are
  two bars available in See-Scape. The bar is open on the second floor dur
 ing our event and is cash only. Debit/Credit purchases are available on t
 he main floor.\n\n\nSee-Scape also has an amazing menu. To learn more abo
 ut See-Scape\, please click here! www.seescapeto.com/ https://www.seescap
 eto.com/\n\n\nSee-Scape is located at 347 Keele Street (the closest inter
 section is Keele/Dundas) and is easily accessible via TTC. (from Keele St
 ation or Dundas West Station)\n\n\nParking: There is a Green P parking lo
 t beside See-Scape and a few other paid parking lots nearby.\n\n\nEach mo
 nth\, join Lizzie Violet & Zoltan Du Lac for killer B-moves from the 1930
 s to the present!\n\n\nPlease like our Facebook page and Instagram @kille
 rbcinema so you don’t miss an invite.\n\n\nThank you to See-Scape and the
 ir staff! They make our monthly event extra unforgettable!\n\n\nWe hope t
 o see you at See-Scape.\n\n
CATEGORIES:Film,See-Scape
