DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Toronto Coin Expo\, Canada’s premier coin and 
 banknote show and auction\, located in downtown Toronto. Featuring 50+ in
 ternationally renowned coin and banknote dealers\, representing Canada\, 
 United States\, and the World of collectable currencies. This is the plac
 e to buy\, sell\, and appraise your coins\, banknotes\, tokens\, medals\,
  militaria\, gold and silver. You are sure to find a one-of-a-kind coin o
 r banknote treasures!\n\nTHIS IS AN EVENT YOU WILL WANT TO ATTEND!\n\nCOI
 N SHOW: Friday May 1 - 10am-5pm & Saturday May 2 - 10am-4pm\n\nAuction: T
 hursday April 30 - Friday May 1\, 2026. - 10:00 am – 10:00 pm. Conducted 
 by Geoffrey Bell Auctions\, offering an assortment of numismatic items. A
 uction is free to attend and open to the public.\n\nEducational Workshops
 : Saturday May 2\, 2026. Kids Collecting Coins - 10:30 am. Collector Work
 shop - 1:00 pm\n\n\nDaily admission is $7\, and Kids 16 and under are FRE
 E!\n\n*no new admissions sold last hour of show.
