SUMMARY: Toronto Film School Showcase | Behind the Screens
DESCRIPTION:Curious what it actually takes to work in film\, TV\, graphic
  design\, or video games? Toronto Film School’s Behind the Screens event 
 gives you a rare look behind the curtain. Step into hands-on workshops\, 
 get up close with professional gear\, explore student work\, and see wher
 e our alumni have taken their creative careers. Discover how ideas become
  real projects – and how creative passion can grow into a career.\n\nWhat
  the day has in store for you:\n\n  * TFS CINEMA – View a curated collect
 ion of our finest student-produced films.\n  * ACTING WORKSHOP – Experien
 ce the atmosphere of a live film set as cameras roll and you take directi
 on in real time.\n  * EQUIPMENT DEMO – Get up close with Hollywood-level 
 cameras\, lenses\, lighting and gear from Sony and other equipment partne
 rs\, with guidance from our Equipment Room Manager.\n  * SCREENWRITING LA
 B – Break down story fundamentals and shape them into a sharp logline in 
 an interactive storytelling challenge.\n  * GAMES DEN – Play student-crea
 ted video games\, challenge yourself on arcade machines\, and explore gam
 e design.\n  * GRAPHIC DESIGN STUDIO – Explore visual storytelling\, expe
 riment with composition\, and bring a graphic concept to life in an inter
 active design activation.\n  * MEET THE CREATIVES – In a speed-networking
  format\, meet TFS alumni\, ask your questions\, and gain practical insig
 ht into building a creative career.\n  * ADMISSIONS LOUNGE – Explore Toro
 nto Film School programs\, meet program directors\, and get personalized 
 guidance on applications\, portfolios\, and next steps toward your creati
 ve career.
CATEGORIES:
