SUMMARY: Mahler's Symphony No. 2 ("Resurrection")
DESCRIPTION:Experience the excitement of the Mandle Philharmonic\, Canada
 ’s newest professional orchestra\, bringing a fresh and inspiring approac
 h to orchestral music. Founded by tech entrepreneur and self-taught condu
 ctor Mandle Cheung\, the ensemble was created from a lifelong passion for
  music and a desire to build something truly unique.\n\n\nLeading a group
  of world-class musicians\, Cheung has created a dynamic new space where 
 artistry\, creativity\, and musical excellence come together. Whether you
 're a longtime classical music enthusiast\, discovering orchestral music 
 for the first time\, or simply looking for an inspiring night out\, Mandl
 e Philharmonic offers an engaging and memorable experience for audiences 
 of all ages.\n\nDesigned to be welcoming and inclusive\, this all-ages pe
 rformance is wheelchair accessible and aims to create an enjoyable experi
 ence for everyone. Doors open at 6:30PM\, giving guests plenty of time to
  arrive and settle in before the performance begins.\n\nJoin us and be pa
 rt of the journey as this exciting new orchestra takes the stage. Purchas
 e your tickets HERE https://www.ticketmaster.ca/event/1000646CB4BCB664 .\
 n\nDate:\n\nFriday\, May 22\, 2026\n\n\nTming:\n\n7:30PM - 9:00PM\n\n\nDu
 ration:\n\n1.5 hours\n\n\nLocation:\n\nNorth York Meridian Arts Centre (5
 040 Yonge St\, North York\, ON M2N 6R8)\n\n\nPrice:\n\n$68–$102 CAD - use
  Promo Code MAH50 for 50%\n\n
