SUMMARY: Forest Raiser!
DESCRIPTION:Forest-Raiser. An evening to raise funds and awareness for fo
 rest conservation and reforestation initiatives.\n\nForests are among our
  most vital ecosystems — providing habitat\, regulating climate\, and sus
 taining life across the planet. This Toronto Climate Week\, we invite you
  to celebrate and support the organizations working to protect them.\n\nM
 ix and mingle over nature-inspired mocktails\, soulful jazz\, and plant-f
 orward delicacies. Immerse yourself in eco-arts and connect with like-min
 ded individuals.\n\nMost important (!) Hear from three purpose-driven org
 anizations and support their work through our silent auction.\n\nThis yea
 r’s beneficiaries are:\n\n• FSC (Forest Stewardship Council) — The Forest
  Stewardship Council (FSC) sets the gold standard for responsible forest 
 management.\n\n• Flash Forest — Modernizing forestry through data-driven 
 automation.\n\n• LEAF (Local Enhancement & Appreciation of Forests) — Eng
 aging GTA communities in urban forest planting\, stewardship and educatio
 n.\n\nForest-Raiser Tuesday\, June 2nd\, 2026 | 6:00 – 9:00 PM Centre for
  Social Innovation\, Toronto\n\nWe look forward to coming together for an
  evening that invests in our forests\, and the future they make possible 
 for all species.\n\nA huge thank you to our volunteers and sponsors makin
 g the event possible. Let’s toast one to the trees!
CATEGORIES:charity-fundraiser-cocktail-party-environment,Centre-for-Socia
 l-Innovation
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/6755f3e6a02aaf
 1c2599e757/69ee3822af02bda0e768ebc0/scaled_768.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Forest-Raiser. An evening to raise funds and awarene
 ss for forest conservation and reforestation initiatives. Forests are amo
 ng our most vital ecosystems —...
LOCATION:Centre for Social Innovation\,192 Spadina Avenue\, Toronto\, ON 
 M5T 2C2\, Canada
