 llowed by a casual social mixer.\n\n2:00pm start time. Free Admission. Re
 serve your spot at Eventbrite. Limited seating available.\n\nJune 20: Mar
 tin van de Ven\n\nComposer Martin van de Ven will bring his clarinet\, wi
 ll share about Klezmer music\, and will share some pieces from the genre\
