SUMMARY: Toronto Film School’s Summer Filmmaking Academy for Teens!
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Film School’s Summer Filmmaking Academy for Teens!\n\
 n  * June 29 to July 3 (no class on July 1) from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m.\n  * $6
 50\n\nIn this intensive TFS Summer Academy https://•%09https:/www.toronto
 filmschool.ca/academy/filmmaking-academy \, participants work alongside T
 oronto Film School instructors to explore every stage of filmmaking—from 
 idea to finished short film. You’ll rotate through key crew roles as you 
 write a script\, plan a shoot\, film on set\, and edit your project\, gai
 ning a clear picture of how a real production comes together.\n\nGuided b
 y working industry professionals\, you’ll collaborate with peers while cr
 eating a finished short film you can use as your first portfolio piece. T
 his week-long academy offers an introductory taste of the same hands-on\,
  industry-driven learning that fuels Toronto Film School’s full-time Film
  Production Diploma Program https://www.torontofilmschool.ca/programs/fil
 m-production/ .\n\n***Applicants must be entering Grade 11 or 12 and be 1
 7 or younger at the academy’s end.
